{"synced": true, "lines": [{"time": 5.92, "text": "And disciplinary remains mercifully"}, {"time": 9.37, "text": "Yes and um, I'm with you Derek, this star nonsense"}, {"time": 12.52, "text": "Yes, yes"}, {"time": 14.05, "text": "Now which is it?"}, {"time": 15.39, "text": "I am sure of it"}, {"time": 20.43, "text": "So, so you think you can tell"}, {"time": 100.79, "text": "Heaven from hell?"}, {"time": 105.35, "text": "Blue skies from pain?"}, {"time": 109.66, "text": "Can you tell a green field"}, {"time": 113.52, "text": "From a cold steel rail?"}, {"time": 117.78, "text": "A smile from a veil?"}, {"time": 121.88, "text": "Do you think you can tell?"}, {"time": 125.99, "text": "Did they get you to trade"}, {"time": 130.02, "text": "Your heroes for ghosts?"}, {"time": 134.11, "text": "Hot ashes for trees?"}, {"time": 138.52, "text": "Hot air for a cool breeze?"}, {"time": 142.4, "text": "Cold comfort for change?"}, {"time": 146.26, "text": "Did you exchange"}, {"time": 149.53, "text": "A walk-on part in the war"}, {"time": 153.44, "text": "For a lead role in a cage?"}, {"time": 160.25, "text": "How I wish, how I wish you were here"}, {"time": 201.7, "text": "We're just two lost souls"}, {"time": 205.01, "text": "Swimming in a fish bowl"}, {"time": 207.85, "text": "Year after year"}, {"time": 211.31, "text": "Running over the same old ground"}, {"time": 215.84, "text": "What have we found?"}, {"time": 218.72, "text": "The same old fears"}, {"time": 221.58, "text": "Wish you were here"}]}